{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 3, "text": "每个寨都有一些大树，人们认为其中有的树有神灵，这种树即被称为“神树”", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 322, "w": 1455, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "每个寨都有一些大树，人们认为其中有的树有神灵，这种树即被称为“神树”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 322, "w": 1455, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 4, "text": "（fai'guu*）。树神能保佑村寨人畜安宁。有的地方小孩爱生病，要把小孩拜寄给树以求保", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 382, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（fai'guu*）。树神能保佑村寨人畜安宁。有的地方小孩爱生病，要把小孩拜寄给树以求保", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 382, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 5, "text": "佑；有的地方扫寨完毕要在神树下杀狗祭树神，祈求树神挡住火星神及各种邪鬼不让进", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 451, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "佑；有的地方扫寨完毕要在神树下杀狗祭树神，祈求树神挡住火星神及各种邪鬼不让进", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 451, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 6, "text": "寨，保佑村寨安宁幸福。在花溪竹林寨，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 515, "w": 728, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "寨，保佑村寨安宁幸福。在花溪竹林寨，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 515, "w": 728, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 7, "text": "树神分别成了男神、女神和龙王神的代", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 579, "w": 732, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "树神分别成了男神、女神和龙王神的代", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 579, "w": 732, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 8, "text": "表，称为“女神仙树”", "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 637, "w": 372, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "表，称为“女神仙树”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 637, "w": 372, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 9, "text": "’“男神仙树”和“龙", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 644, "w": 370, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "’“男神仙树”和“龙", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 644, "w": 370, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 10, "text": "王神树”。“女神仙树”为檬子树，相传很", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 712, "w": 724, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "王神树”。“女神仙树”为檬子树，相传很", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 712, "w": 724, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 11, "text": "久以前人们常从远处看见檬子树上有一", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 781, "w": 728, "h": 40}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "久以前人们常从远处看见檬子树上有一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 781, "w": 728, "h": 40}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 12, "text": "位美丽的布依姑娘，有时则见她坐在树下", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 845, "w": 724, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "位美丽的布依姑娘，有时则见她坐在树下", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 845, "w": 724, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 13, "text": "唱歌，但当小伙子们走近时，却什么也看", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 909, "w": 724, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "唱歌，但当小伙子们走近时，却什么也看", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 909, "w": 724, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 14, "text": "不见。于是以此树有神。人们头痛、腰", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 974, "w": 728, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不见。于是以此树有神。人们头痛、腰", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 974, "w": 728, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 15, "text": "痛，就用斋饭、净茶和香烛前去供祭以求", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1038, "w": 724, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "痛，就用斋饭、净茶和香烛前去供祭以求", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1038, "w": 724, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 16, "text": "清净吉祥，消灾避祸。“男神仙树”在寨子", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1098, "w": 728, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "清净吉祥，消灾避祸。“男神仙树”在寨子", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1098, "w": 728, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 17, "text": "左侧，与寨右的“女神仙树”遥遥相对。这", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1163, "w": 724, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "左侧，与寨右的“女神仙树”遥遥相对。这", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1163, "w": 724, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 18, "text": "是一棵香樟树，据说可以保寨安民，常有", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1231, "w": 724, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是一棵香樟树，据说可以保寨安民，常有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1231, "w": 724, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 19, "text": "人到树下祭供，祈求保佑。每年春节期间", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1291, "w": 732, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人到树下祭供，祈求保佑。每年春节期间", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1291, "w": 732, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 20, "text": "的上九（初九）之夜，人们敲锣打鼓，把龙", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1360, "w": 724, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的上九（初九）之夜，人们敲锣打鼓，把龙", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1360, "w": 724, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 21, "text": "灯和两个宝灯拿到树下祭供。“龙王神", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1420, "w": 728, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "灯和两个宝灯拿到树下祭供。“龙王神", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1420, "w": 728, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 22, "text": "树”是一棵皂角树，生长在寨脚的井边。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1485, "w": 732, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "树”是一棵皂角树，生长在寨脚的井边。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1485, "w": 732, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 23, "text": "据说这棵皂角树是龙王的化身，它管辖着", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1553, "w": 732, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "据说这棵皂角树是龙王的化身，它管辖着", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1553, "w": 732, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 24, "text": "井和水，因此人们每年耍龙灯都要先到井", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1617, "w": 728, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "井和水，因此人们每年耍龙灯都要先到井", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1617, "w": 728, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 25, "text": "边向它燃香点烛，求它赐给泉水。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1682, "w": 579, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "边向它燃香点烛，求它赐给泉水。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1682, "w": 579, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 26, "text": "神树以檬子树、榕树、香樟树、楠木、", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1750, "w": 647, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神树以檬子树、榕树、香樟树、楠木、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1750, "w": 647, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 27, "text": "荔波县联山湾布依村寨神树", "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1778, "w": 422, "h": 36}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "荔波县联山湾布依村寨神树", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1778, "w": 422, "h": 36}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 28, "text": "皂角树等为多，可能与这些或四季常青，", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1810, "w": 732, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "皂角树等为多，可能与这些或四季常青，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1810, "w": 732, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 29, "text": "或枝叶繁茂，亭亭如盖，似能给人以荫庇，便拜之为神了。与原始宗教的万物有灵、自然", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1879, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "或枝叶繁茂，亭亭如盖，似能给人以荫庇，便拜之为神了。与原始宗教的万物有灵、自然", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1879, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 30, "text": "崇拜相比，这种有选择的崇信是布依族先民物质文化发展的结果。因为凡树皆有神，那", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1943, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "崇拜相比，这种有选择的崇信是布依族先民物质文化发展的结果。因为凡树皆有神，那", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1943, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 31, "text": "么不能砍伐神树加工成物件这一禁忌势必对人们的生产生活带来极大不便。这对于从", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2004, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "么不能砍伐神树加工成物件这一禁忌势必对人们的生产生活带来极大不便。这对于从", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2004, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 32, "text": "事稻作农耕的布依族先民来说，是不可想象的。浙江余姚河姆渡新石器时代文化遗址发", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2068, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "事稻作农耕的布依族先民来说，是不可想象的。浙江余姚河姆渡新石器时代文化遗址发", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2068, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 33, "text": "掘出榫卯结构的干栏建筑遗存，说明古百越人在新石器时代就已发明了干栏建筑。由此", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2132, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "掘出榫卯结构的干栏建筑遗存，说明古百越人在新石器时代就已发明了干栏建筑。由此", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2132, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 34, "text": "推知，由古百越演化来的布依族的这种有选择的树神崇拜发生的时间应该是比较早的。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2201, "w": 1516, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "推知，由古百越演化来的布依族的这种有选择的树神崇拜发生的时间应该是比较早的。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2201, "w": 1516, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 139, "line_no": 35, "text": "6. 鲍更嫡（pau'tun’ti®）", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2261, "w": 418, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "6. 鲍更嫡（pau'tun’ti®）", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2261, "w": 418, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
